{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44693","headline":"在西国怀王舍城 · 义净","name":"在西国怀王舍城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游，愁。\n赤县远，丹思抽。\n鹫岭寒风驶，龙河激水流。\n既喜朝闻日复日，不觉颓年秋更秋。\n已毕耆山本愿城难遇，终望持经振锡住神州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}